# Audio Placeholder File

This file represents the gentle breathing audio that would be used in the sacred onboarding ceremony.

## Audio Specifications:
- Format: MP3 and OGG for browser compatibility
- Duration: 4-6 seconds (one breath cycle)
- Loop: Designed to loop seamlessly
- Content: Soft inhale/exhale sounds or nature-inspired breathing guide
- Volume: Very low, ambient level
- Frequency: Calming, low frequencies to promote relaxation

## Implementation Notes:
- Audio is optional and user-controlled
- Includes accessibility considerations for hearing-impaired users
- Respects user preferences for audio/visual feedback
- Falls back gracefully if audio fails to load

## Production Requirements:
Replace this placeholder with actual audio files:
- /public/audio/gentle-breathing.mp3
- /public/audio/gentle-breathing.ogg

Consider using royalty-free meditation or breathing exercise audio, or record custom audio that aligns with ALCHM's sacred, trauma-informed approach.